        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 8. SEQUENCE: UC-03 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Sequence_UC03\ntitle UC-03 — Analyze Audio Recording\nautonumber\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\ncontrol \&quot;Sada Banking Platform\&quot; as Platform\ncontrol \&quot;Sada AI Controller\&quot; as AI\ncollections \&quot;AI Scratch Storage\&quot; as Scratch\ncontrol \&quot;Audio Preprocessor\&quot; as Prep\ncontrol \&quot;Deepfake Classifier\&quot; as Model\ndatabase \&quot;Assessment Database\&quot; as DB\nPlatform -&gt; AI: Submit audio payload and assessment reference\nactivate AI\nAI -&gt; Scratch: Write temporary scratch file\nactivate Scratch\nScratch --&gt; AI: Scratch file reference\ndeactivate Scratch\nAI -&gt; Prep: Validate file and assess quality\nactivate Prep\nPrep --&gt; AI: Validity and quality result\ndeactivate Prep\nalt Unsupported or corrupted file\n AI -&gt; DB: Store validation failure metadata\n DB --&gt; AI: Failure record ID\n AI -&gt; Scratch: Delete scratch file\n activate Scratch\n Scratch --&gt; AI: Deletion result\n deactivate Scratch\n AI --&gt; Platform: Invalid audio result\nelse File valid\n alt Audio quality insufficient\n  AI -&gt; DB: Store insufficient-quality assessment\n  DB --&gt; AI: Assessment ID\n  AI -&gt; Scratch: Delete scratch file\n  activate Scratch\n  Scratch --&gt; AI: Deletion result\n  deactivate Scratch\n  AI --&gt; Platform: INSUFFICIENT_QUALITY result\n else Audio quality sufficient\n  AI -&gt; Prep: Convert to mono 16 kHz and normalize\n  activate Prep\n  Prep --&gt; AI: Normalized signal\n  AI -&gt; Prep: Segment signal into configured windows\n  Prep --&gt; AI: Audio windows\n  deactivate Prep\n  AI -&gt; Model: Compute window-level spoof scores\n  activate Model\n  Model --&gt; AI: Window-level scores\n  AI -&gt; AI: Aggregate scores and apply calibrated threshold\n  deactivate Model\n  AI -&gt; DB: Store score, threshold and traceability metadata\n  DB --&gt; AI: Assessment ID\n  AI -&gt; Scratch: Delete scratch file\n  activate Scratch\n  Scratch --&gt; AI: Deletion result\n  deactivate Scratch\n  AI --&gt; Platform: Assessment ID, score and quality status\n end\nend\ndeactivate AI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="vPecKsJ7qy07KvzmN1Pw-1">
